# Manifold level 10
# The tower's first floor (stage 5d; lengthened in 5p, decision 0031: floors as rhythm): the wall jump,
# demanded, over the void (a fall, back to the last checkpoint). Up a chimney 2.4 m wide to a terrace 6 m
# up; across 2.5 m to a pillar (walking, 3.75); a ledge 3 m up (up to 3.25); up a chimney 3.2 m wide over
# nothing to a terrace 15 m up (a rest, its checkpoint); across 2.5 m to another pillar, and up a chimney
# 4 m wide over nothing to the goal, 24 m up, its beacon lit from the start. Stars: at the top of a chimney
# 2.4 m wide and 12 m high beside the start; on a pillar a running jump off the first terrace (5 m); and on
# a block 3 m high on the terrace 15 m up (its ledge).
title The first floor
spawn 0 1 7
facing 0 0 -1
ambient 0.85
sky 19.0

# The start, a balcony.
kit floor_4  -2 0 4
kit floor_4  2 0 4
kit floor_4  6 0 4
kit floor_4  -2 0 8
kit floor_4  2 0 8
kit floor_4  6 0 8

# Chimney 1, 2.4 m wide, its floor the balcony's, on from it; terrace B, 6 m up.
kit floor_2  0 0 -5
kit floor_2  0 0 -3
kit floor_2  0 0 -1
kit floor_2  0 0 1
kit wall_4  -1.35 -3 -4  rotate y 90
kit wall_4  -1.35 0 -4  rotate y 90
kit wall_4  -1.35 3 -4  rotate y 90
kit wall_4  1.35 -3 -4  rotate y 90
